00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:59.020
And it's handle. If you pull it ............

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.120
What is the condition of the room below? Is it possible to go there?

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.460
Yes! possible

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.560
This is the way to go

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:31.080
These woods would move and then

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:35.700
height?

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:40.760
Here will be a gap of 7/8 feet from top to bottom

00:21:45.220 --> 00:21:46.120
Now I'm running away from here

00:21:49.020 --> 00:21:52.280
Dead bodies were taken out from here

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:53.480
What's this side?

00:21:57.260 --> 00:22:01.120
Oh! From here people were taken inside. This is the door

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:03.980
Oh! From here people were taken inside. This is the door

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:07.660
Oh! From here people were taken inside. This is the door

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:11.920
This was brought through the door

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:17.320
Although it was the first experience of my life to see the gallows

00:22:19.000 --> 00:22:22.200
There are 4 shows every day. The show starts at 5:45.

00:22:22.560 --> 00:22:24.840
Tickets for the first show are Rs 150

00:22:25.080 --> 00:22:26.400
for the second show also Rs 150

00:22:26.640 --> 00:22:28.120
for the third show Rs 100

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:29.320
for the fourth show Rs 50

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:32.420
This is the ticket price for all the shows

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:34.600
I will not watch the show

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:39.340
Because the history of torture will be described here.

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:43.400
I don’t have the mental capacity to hear this

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:48.720
All this hurts me!

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:52.880
All most done

00:22:54.720 --> 00:22:56.360
Let's go back to the hotel

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:58.160
Need to sleep

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:07.400
Do you hear the sound of frogs?

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:12.520
Looks like procession

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:13.580
anyway

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.320
I'm in the room now

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:18.800
Didn’t go out.

00:23:19.060 --> 00:23:24.520
I was talking to the hotel manager and owner

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:25.920
then come back to room

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:26.820
What time is it now?

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.360
10:13 pm

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:37.860
Haven't eaten dinner yet

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:42.320
Everything is closed here before 11pm

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:44.740
I'll not get food if i'm late

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.360
I will go to sleep after eating

00:23:48.600 --> 00:23:50.140
48 hours have passed and I am still awake

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:53.020
and

00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:55.680
My Havelock ferry is early morning

00:23:56.680 --> 00:23:59.840
I will leave at 5 o'clock

00:24:00.280 --> 00:24:01.300
I don’t want to take risk

00:24:01.360 --> 00:24:03.480
Now I am not talking about Havelock anymore

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:08.240
I'll share total information about Havelock tomorrow

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:08.900
Allah Hafez!

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:12.480
Will see if alive

